19a-465d-994a-25e5c1c7f604.mp3?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=interactive-edu-minio/20260616/us-east-1/s3/aws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260616T144336Z&X-Amz-Expires=3600&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Signature=65000bcd2c73f90d5b44c5f45381df10167d9e4fe4710f8a5f60fca1873e8815","pageImagePath":"/app/data/render/cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634/visual/pages/page_3.png","pageImageUrl":"/api/v1/courseware/cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634/pages/3/image","visualSummary":"本页包含 5 张图片。可重点关注：图表/图片、流程图/示意图。","visualObjects":["图表/图片","流程图/示意图"],"digitalHumanEnabled":false},{"id":"cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634_node_004","nodeId":"cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634_node_004","pageIndex":4,"title":"no. of views","content":"这里给出了11月18日的观看次数数据，这类真实数据点就是训练和评估函数的基础，我们的目标是在这些点上做到整体误差最小","knowledgePoints":["3.2 线性回归","no. of views"],"audioUrl":"http://localhost:9000/courseware/tts-audio/2026/06/5b2d605a-5313-43ab-a5e1-2c05d6c31900.mp3?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=interactive-edu-minio/20260616/us-east-1/s3/aws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260616T144337Z&X-Amz-Expires=3600&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Signature=c27fd01b20d388ed8bca8823ec20c8269506088bb691896aa6592528b7465941","pageImagePath":"/app/data/render/cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634/visual/pages/page_4.png","pageImageUrl":"/api/v1/courseware/cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634/pages/4/image","visualSummary":"本页包含 1 张图片。可重点关注：图表/图片、流程图/示意图。","visualObjects":["图表/图片","流程图/示意图"],"digitalHumanEnabled":false},{"id":"cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634_node_005","nodeId":"cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634_node_005","pageIndex":5,"title":"Typical process of ML","content":"机器学习典型流程可以概括成三步：先根据领域知识设计一个带有未知参数的函数模型，然后利用训练数据定义一个损失来衡量这些参数的好坏，最后通过优化算法找到让损失最小的参数值","knowledgePoints":["3.2 线性回归","Typical process of ML"],"audioUrl":"http://localhost:9000/courseware/tts-audio/2026/06/5f645800-939a-4057-bfb9-c66a1fb14678.mp3?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=interactive-edu-minio/20260616/us-east-1/s3/aws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260616T144345Z&X-Amz-Expires=3600&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Signature=4749f9de65246795ed250aa77d41849fc6228cf8a0013251dba3e609fabad13b","pageImagePath":"/app/data/render/cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634/visual/pages/page_5.png","pageImageUrl":"/api/v1/courseware/cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634/pages/5/image","visualSummary":"本页包含 27 张图片。可重点关注：图表/图片。","visualObjects":["图表/图片"],"digitalHumanEnabled":false},{"id":"cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634_node_006","nodeId":"cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634_node_006","pageIndex":6,"title":"Step1: Function with Unknown","content":"第一步里这个函数就是我们要学习的模型，比方说预测频道隔日观看次数时，可以用前一天的观看量作为特征，乘上一个未知权重再加上一个未知偏置。这里的权重和偏置就是需要从数据中找出来的参数","knowledgePoints":["3.2 线性回归","Step1: Function with Unknown"],"audioUrl":"http://localhost:9000/courseware/tts-audio/2026/06/ff403158-56d0-4a7a-bc7f-63b39d50c5e5.mp3?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=interactive-edu-minio/20260616/us-east-1/s3/aws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260616T144347Z&X-Amz-Expires=3600&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Signature=e31720ff148a99339b6cc579fe9dc66619a84c3462f811a0a8d063c95718d715","pageImagePath":"/app/data/render/cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634/visual/pages/page_6.png","pageImageUrl":"/api/v1/courseware/cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634/pages/6/image","visualSummary":"本页包含 1 张图片。可重点关注：图表/图片、流程图/示意图。","visualObjects":["图表/图片","流程图/示意图"],"digitalHumanEnabled":false},{"id":"cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634_node_007","nodeId":"cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634_node_007","pageIndex":7,"title":"Step2: Define Loss from Training Data","content":"第二步是定义损失函数，它本质上是参数的函数，用来给每一组参数值打分，告诉我们这组参数到底有多好。损失越小说明参数越贴合训练数据，所以后续优化的目标就是把损失降下来","knowledgePoints":["3.2 线性回归","Step2: Define Loss from Training Data"],"audioUrl":"http://localhost:9000/courseware/tts-audio/2026/06/ee8a5bb5-ec54-4e09-936a-f8c826ff78b3.mp3?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=interactive-edu-minio/20260616/us-east-1/s3/aws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260616T144352Z&X-Amz-Expires=3600&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Signature=c82f3cb4c9f784b6c7a8374c2b27dd271c3226ecd12795b459117e7304b8557e","pageImagePath":"/app/data/render/cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634/visual/pages/page_7.png","pageImageUrl":"/api/v1/courseware/cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634/pages/7/image","visualSummary":"本页包含 2 张图片。可重点关注：图表/图片、流程图/示意图。","visualObjects":["图表/图片","流程图/示意图"],"digitalHumanEnabled":false},{"id":"cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634_node_008","nodeId":"cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634_node_008","pageIndex":8,"title":"Step2: Define Loss from Training Data","content":"定义损失时我们要把训练数据中的真实结果和模型预测结果做比较，比如计算两者之间的差距再汇总起来。通过这种方式，参数的好坏就有了一个可量化的指标，为后面的优化提供明确方向","knowledgePoints":["3.2 线性回归","Step2: Define Loss from Training Data"],"audioUrl":"http://localhost:9000/courseware/tts-audio/2026/06/cdf04044-ff84-402f-815d-8702093c2e29.mp3?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=interactive-edu-minio/20260616/us-east-1/s3/aws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260616T144350Z&X-Amz-Expires=3600&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Signature=1358065a6650b3ded16c1d778336248bae4fde391b96c0d1f9128172c621d9a0","pageImagePath":"/app/data/render/cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634/visual/pages/page_8.png","pageImageUrl":"/api/v1/courseware/cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634/pages/8/image","visualSummary":"本页包含 3 张图片。可重点关注：图表/图片、流程图/示意图。","visualObjects":["图表/图片","流程图/示意图"],"digitalHumanEnabled":false},{"id":"cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634_node_009","nodeId":"cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634_node_009","pageIndex":9,"title":"Step2: Define Loss from Training Data","content":"这一步要定义损失函数，用它来量化模型预测和真实值之间的偏差。损失越小说明当前参数越适合训练数据，常见的选择有平均绝对误差和均方误差，前者用绝对值衡量，后者用平方放大较大误差的影响","knowledgePoints":["3.2 线性回归","Step2: Define Loss from Training Data"],"audioUrl":"http://localhost:9000/courseware/tts-audio/2026/06/d13ab849-cf7c-4bbb-8b07-250e316d5d38.mp3?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=interactive-edu-minio/20260616/us-east-1/s3/aws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260616T144355Z&X-Amz-Expires=3600&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Signature=3b49acbfc424a22f07a17bfac4d9dbd4fe9f0ca410fdc456b5a7fadfdb1d0b8a","pageImagePath":"/app/data/render/cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634/visual/pages/page_9.png","pageImageUrl":"/api/v1/courseware/cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634/pages/9/image","visualSummary":"本页包含 2 张图片。可重点关注：图表/图片、流程图/示意图。","visualObjects":["图表/图片","流程图/示意图"],"digitalHumanEnabled":false},{"id":"cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634_node_010","nodeId":"cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634_node_010","pageIndex":10,"title":"Think/Pair/Share","content":"这里是一个思考、配对、分享的互动环节，目的是先让大家独立理清思路，然后通过交流碰撞来检验和深化对损失函数的理解，而不只是被动接收信息","knowledgePoints":["3.2 线性回归","Think/Pair/Share"],"audioUrl":"http://localhost:9000/courseware/tts-audio/2026/06/75017a4c-7cf1-440e-af61-02754ecaaf98.mp3?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=interactive-edu-minio/20260616/us-east-1/s3/aws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260616T144355Z&X-Amz-Expires=3600&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Signature=5e90486353e0d53812d1aaccd18dfa4a503438ed9f1c311578b5ad3395976548","pageImagePath":"/app/data/render/cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634/visual/pages/page_10.png","pageImageUrl":"/api/v1/courseware/cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634/pages/10/image","visualSummary":"本页包含 1 张图片。可重点关注：图表/图片、流程图/示意图。","visualObjects":["图表/图片","流程图/示意图"],"digitalHumanEnabled":false},{"id":"cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634_node_011","nodeId":"cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634_node_011","pageIndex":11,"title":"Linear Regression Algorithm","content":"线性回归算法的核心就是用损失函数来指导参数选择。对于只有两个参数的模型，均方误差和平均绝对误差会呈现出不同的误差曲面，在图上能直观看到哪些区域损失低、哪些区域损失高，这对理解参数优化很有帮助","knowledgePoints":["3.2 线性回归","Linear Regression Algorithm"],"audioUrl":"http://localhost:9000/courseware/tts-audio/2026/06/ff13275c-bc92-4a86-9ec9-869f07379739.mp3?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=interactive-edu-minio/20260616/us-east-1/s3/aws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260616T144401Z&X-Amz-Expires=3600&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Signature=1855111dffa2e7bbae5533f2cffc4cf64f3d3931d660a03fa450bb2f0a30c939","pageImagePath":"/app/data/render/cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634/visual/pages/page_11.png","pageImageUrl":"/api/v1/courseware/cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634/pages/11/image","visualSummary":"本页包含 36 张图片。可重点关注：图表/图片。","visualObjects":["图表/图片"],"digitalHumanEnabled":false},{"id":"cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634_node_012","nodeId":"cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634_node_012","pageIndex":12,"title":"Step2: Define Loss from Training Data","content":"损失函数本质上就是给参数集合打一个分数，分数越低表示模型拟合得越好。当模型预测精确时损失值很小，如果预测偏离很远损失值就会明显变大，而损失面的起伏则决定了我们能否快速找到最优参数","knowledgePoints":["3.2 线性回归","Step2: Define Loss from Training Data"],"audioUrl":"http://localhost:9000/courseware/tts-audio/2026/06/57f46af0-3912-4069-9d4c-e4fa2e31da66.mp3?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=interactive-edu-minio/20260616/us-east-1/s3/aws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260616T144402Z&X-Amz-Expires=3600&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Signature=23872836d270c94faff5e3400635473e6d04a997ec3d4b748a0a94373aa3f47a","pageImagePath":"/app/data/render/cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634/visual/pages/page_12.png","pageImageUrl":"/api/v1/courseware/cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634/pages/12/image","visualSummary":"本页包含 1 张图片。可重点关注：图表/图片。","visualObjects":["图表/图片"],"digitalHumanEnabled":false},{"id":"cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634_node_013","nodeId":"cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634_node_013","pageIndex":13,"title":"Step3: Optimization","content":"这一步要解决的问题是，当损失函数构建好之后，模型参数如何朝着让损失变小的方向调整。在一维情况下，我们看的是导数，它告诉我们函数变化的斜率；到了多维参数空间，就需要用梯度这个工具，它把每个参数方向的偏导数整合成一个向量，指向函数上升最快的方向，优化时通常沿着相反方向走一小步，这就是梯度下降的基本思想","knowledgePoints":["3.2 线性回归","Step3: Optimization"],"audioUrl":"http://localhost:9000/courseware/tts-audio/2026/06/7729f493-6b20-41f7-b223-a99c76656a7b.mp3?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=interactive-edu-minio/20260616/us-east-1/s3/aws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260616T144408Z&X-Amz-Expires=3600&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Signature=4535d8875a0e7b513f55211c638de9110d7f6e3124c209d4020d545e315ace6b","pageImagePath":"/app/data/render/cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634/visual/pages/page_13.png","pageImageUrl":"/api/v1/courseware/cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634/pages/13/image","visualSummary":"本页包含 7 张图片。可重点关注：图表/图片。","visualObjects":["图表/图片"],"digitalHumanEnabled":false},{"id":"cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634_node_014","nodeId":"cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634_node_014","pageIndex":14,"title":"Practice","content":"这里是一道计算梯度的练习。重点不是把数字罗列出来，而是先确认损失函数关于哪些参数求偏导，再按链式法则一步步推出每个方向的梯度分量，最后得到梯度向量，后续就可以用它来指导参数更新","knowledgePoints":["3.2 线性回归","Practice"],"audioUrl":"http://localhost:9000/courseware/tts-audio/2026/06/1859999d-bbe9-40e7-b02a-c9a2da857f53.mp3?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=interactive-edu-minio/20260616/us-east-1/s3/aws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260616T144405Z&X-Amz-Expires=3600&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Signature=24205fcf01e42aa687d0895a2527ac1e71ff67920fb8474e807152e136eed97b","pageImagePath":"/app/data/render/cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634/visual/pages/page_14.png","pageImageUrl":"/api/v1/courseware/cware_45521fa1070c4388b06de3d9c7421634/pages/14/image","visualSummary":"本页包含 18 张图片。可重点关注：图表/图片。","visualObjects":["图表/图片"],"digitalHumanEnabled":false}],"status":"READY","opening":"这节内容重点梳理How to find a good function?相关的核心知识点，尽量把概念、关系和计算逻辑讲清楚","closing":"关于How to find a good function?的核心思路先梳理到这里，后面可以再把关键概念、计算关系和典型场景连起来复习"}}